OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cool and cloudy across
OL,6,FArgyll with a few showers but brighter
OL,7,Facross the Isles. Elsewhere, mainly
OL,8,Fdry with sunny spells and just the odd
OL,9,Fshower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening with any
OL,12,Fshowers dying out. A dry start to the
OL,13,Fnight but thicker cloud and patchy
OL,14,Frain will soon spread eastwards.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA cool and cloudy day is
OL,17,Fexpected with outbreaks of rain,
OL,18,Fperhaps turning heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
